<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Chemical yr profit slumps. [CORRECTED 07:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Chemical yr profit slumps. [CORRECTED 07:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30 (corrects from June 30)</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 10.62 vs 13.45</p>
<p>    Net profit			  6.41 vs 9.69</p>
<p>    Sales			     187.30 vs 194.22</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	   9.0 vs 11.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend		    18.0 vs 20.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Australian Chemical Holdings Ltd is a chemical producer with operations in Australia and New Zealand. Latest dividend is fully franked.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
